  "local_changes": [
    "backend/dx12/ffx_dx12.cpp: OWN_FI_NO_PIX build option",
    "framegeneration/fsr3/internal/ffx_frameinterpolation.cpp: the reconstruct-previous-depth dispatch is not scheduled; the game motion vector field pass does its depth splat",
    "framegeneration/fsr3/include/gpu/frameinterpolation/ffx_frameinterpolation_game_motion_vector_field.h: the field and depth atomics load their cell first and are taken only where they can still change it; the depth splat of the reconstruct-previous-depth pass runs in this pass",
    "framegeneration/fsr3/include/gpu/frameinterpolation/ffx_frameinterpolation_reconstruct_dilated_velocity_and_previous_depth.h: the depth atomic loads its cell first and is taken only where the depth is nearer",
    "framegeneration/fsr3/include/gpu/frameinterpolation/ffx_frameinterpolation_reconstruct_previous_depth.h: the depth atomic loads its cell first and is taken only where the depth is nearer",
    "framegeneration/fsr3/internal/shaders/ffx_frameinterpolation_game_motion_vector_field_pass.hlsl: the estimated depth of the generated frame is bound to the game motion vector field pass for writing"
  ],
